NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002616 "L<Alien::Build::Manual::FAQ>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002617 "L<Alien::Build::Manual::PluginAuthor>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002618 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002619 "L<alienfile>, L<Alien::Build::MM>, L<Alien::Build::Plugin>, L<Alien::Base>, L<Alien>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002620 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002621 "=head1 THANKS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002622 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002623 "L<Alien::Base> was originally written by Joel Berger, the rest of this project would"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002624 "not have been possible without him getting the project started.  Thanks to his support"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002625 "I have been able to augment the original L<Alien::Base> system with a reliable set"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002626 "of tools (L<Alien::Build>, L<alienfile>, L<Test::Alien>), which make up this toolset."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002627 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002628 "The original L<Alien::Base> is still copyright (c) 2012-2020 Joel Berger.  It has"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002629 "the same license as the rest of the Alien::Build and related tools distributed as"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002630 "C<Alien-Build>.  Joel Berger thanked a number of people who helped in in the development"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002631 "of L<Alien::Base>, in the documentation for that module."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002632 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002633 "I would also like to acknowledge the other members of the PerlAlien github"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002634 "organization, Zakariyya Mughal (sivoais, ZMUGHAL) and mohawk (ETJ).  Also important"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002635 "in the early development of L<Alien::Build> were the early adopters Chase Whitener"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002636 "(genio, CAPOEIRAB, author of L<Alien::libuv>), William N. Braswell, Jr (willthechill,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002637 "WBRASWELL, author of L<Alien::JPCRE2> and L<Alien::PCRE2>) and Ahmad Fatoum (a3f,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002638 "ATHREEF, author of L<Alien::libudev> and L<Alien::LibUSB>)."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002639 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002640 "The Alien ecosystem owes a debt to Dan Book, who goes by Grinnz on IRC, for answering"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002641 "question about how to use L<Alien::Build> and friends."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00002642 ""
